architecture-audit/cycle-011-architecture-tests-validation-gates/implementation-log.md:104:These failures are classified as pre-existing/unrelated because Wave 011 touched package scripts, architecture tests, one app-shell boundary test, Playwright config comments, and deleted the unreferenced examples/debug menu/command. It did not modify guide-creation integration tests, intersection calculation tests/implementation, PropertiesDialog behavior/tests, `vue-tsc`/TypeScript versions, or the corrupted broad e2e specs. The focused Wave 011 gates and representative Playwright guard pass.
